			"hadithnumber": 2877,
			"arabicnumber": 2877,
			"text": "It was narrated that Ibn ‘Umar said:“The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) made a horse lean, and he would send the horse that he had made lean from Hafya’ to Thaniyyatul-Wada’, and (he would send) the horse that he had not made lean from Thaniyyatul-Wada’ to the mosque of Banu Zuraiq.”",
